menu "Lamp"

config LAMP_LEVELS
    int "Brightness levels above off"
    range 2 100
    default 30
    help
        One encoder detent per level; 30 is one full turn from off to full.

config LAMP_MIN_BRIGHTNESS_PERMILLE
    int "Brightness of level 1 (permille of full)"
    range 1 1000
    default 20
    help
        Levels rise in equal ratios from here to full. SK6812 channels are
        8 bit, so much lower makes dim colours drop out.

config LAMP_DEFAULT_BUDGET_MA
    int "Default LED current budget (mA)"
    range 50 2000
    default 400
    help
        Fits a laptop USB port. Raise it with 'budget' on a 5 V / 3 A supply.
        Capped 200 mA below LAMP_OVERCURRENT_MA.

config LAMP_OVERCURRENT_MA
    int "Measured LED current that latches LED power off (mA)"
    range 300 2200
    default 1800
    help
        Just under U402's 2.04 A limit. The budget is capped 200 mA below.

endmenu
